m3t provides CMake targets:

    find_package(M3T CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE m3t)

The m3t target propagates C++17 and all transitive dependencies
(Eigen3, GLEW, glfw3, OpenGL, OpenCV, OpenMP).

TextureModality (keypoint-based tracking) is only available when the
port is installed with the "texture" feature: m3t[texture].
